  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Performance powerhouse! Keep your momentum strong with the Nike Zoom Vomero 5 NA38. Taking early-2000s running to modern heights, these shoes combine breathable and durable materials to keep your stride light and cool. The Zoom Air cushioning delivers that snappy, quick-off-the-ground feel, while the plastic side caging adds structured support for every transition. Accented with a rugged rubber outsole that offers lasting traction, these shoes let you bounce from workouts to walkouts with ease. Push boundaries, stay fresh, and run your day in the Nike Zoom Vomero 5 NA38.</p> <p><strong>Nike Zoom Vomero 5 NA38 features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Synthetic leather and textile on the upper adds durability.</li> <li>Reflective details ensure safety during low-light conditions.</li> <li>Plastic caging on the side enhances support.</li> <li>Zoom Air cushioning helps provide a quick-off-the-ground sensation.</li> <li>Rubber outsole offers durable traction.</li> </ul> <p>*Not intended for use as Personal Protective Equipment (PPE).</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Zoom Vomero 5 NA38 - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Photon Dust/Metallic Silver/Hydrogen Blue</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</